== emr module: prefix locals and statements
48:  read_prefixes = ["raw/", "curated/", "artifacts/"]
51:  write_prefixes = ["curated/", "logs/emr/"]
52:  # ListBucket only under the prefixes the role reads or writes (s3:prefix condition).
53:  list_prefixes = distinct(concat(local.read_prefixes, local.write_prefixes))
144:    sid       = "BucketLevel"
150:    sid       = "ListOwnPrefixes"
156:      variable = "s3:prefix"
157:      values   = [for p in local.list_prefixes : "${p}*"]
162:    sid       = "ReadInputs"
164:    resources = [for p in local.read_prefixes : "${local.b}/${p}*"]
168:    sid = "WriteOutputs"
175:    resources = [for p in local.write_prefixes : "${local.b}/${p}*"]
== emr module: any dropped prefix (graph/ semantic-context/ runs/ reports/)?
46:  # jobs write curated/hadoop and curated/spark; EMR pushes logs to logs/emr/. No graph/,
